8.8 Where to go next
====================

   • ‘M-x subtle-manual’ for every option, command, hook and face, and
     for the functions you can call from your own code.
   • The Info manual: ‘C-h i d m subtle RET’.
   • ‘M-x bookmark-set’ in a subtle buffer saves your place: media,
     subtitles and time.  Jumping to it reopens them a few seconds
     earlier, paused; set ‘subtle-bookmark-autoplay’ to start playing at
     once.


